translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_7fd58acd:


    "从分开的唇瓣中漏出了甜美的喘息。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_2b4b7285:



    voice "FUM_1165"
    fumi "「哈……伦接吻的技巧，越来越熟练了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_5d60f998:



    voice "RIN_1331"
    rin "「是，是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_0f169f53:


    "今天也是。放学后，趁阳菜从职员室回来之前的短暂幽会。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_eb4cae03:



    voice "RIN_1332"
    rin "「我说，文？有个问题以前我就想问了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_8b50fdbb:



    voice "FUM_1166"
    fumi "「好的，什么问题呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_7bbaed07:



    voice "RIN_1333"
    rin "「文觉得当攻好还是受好？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_a98382b7:



    voice "FUM_1167"
    fumi "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_af5d59a4:


    "文一脸不明所以的样子。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_dc2add90:



    voice "FUM_1168"
    fumi "「如果问我是狗派还是猫派，那我是狗派」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_ba23b941:



