translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_60e94756:



    voice "RIN_1336"
    rin "「我？我的话……应该是吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_0cf20355:



    voice "FUM_1173"
    fumi "「这样……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_2991366a:



    voice "RIN_1337"
    rin "「该怎么说呢，文比我要更女孩子气得多，自然而然就觉得应该那样」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_46e43321:



    voice "FUM_1174"
    fumi "「哎呀，我倒是认为伦也很有女孩子的魅力哦？说不定还比我更有这种感觉」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_04db1a28:



    voice "RIN_1338"
    rin "「是这样吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_57f67e9e:


    "伦一副摸不着头脑的样子。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_8b919d48:



    voice "FUM_1175"
    fumi "「但是，前段时间的晚上，很厉害对吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_9634909f:



    voice "RIN_1339"
    rin "「很厉——！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_1af5d318:


    "伦想起那个时候，羞耻得说不出话。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_1eec8d7d:



    voice "FUM_1176"
    fumi "「那之后本来想睡了，结果床单湿乎乎的——」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_04_b4acbfd3:



